WEBVTT

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:23.790
Your initials I wrote in my notebook

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:31.600
Discreetly overlapping so they won't be noticed

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.110
I stretched up

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.110
The school building I looked up at and the distant sky

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:53.690
The moon in broad daylight shows some restraint and lingers inside the light.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:01.310
I want these feelings to reach you

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.520
my heart

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:11.500
I embrace the small bud of passion that sprouted in my heart

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:13.880
I close my eyes

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:18.170
Some day I want to make it bloom into a big flower

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.750
someday

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:26.940
Our fluttering hearts connected, our eyes exchanging a glance

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:55.080
What are you doing, Ichitaka?

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.230
Taking a picture...

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.310
I want to mail it to Itsuki.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.070
Yeah? That's pretty thoughtful of you.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.490
Well, I guess I have to watch the movie first.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.020
Give it to me. I'll take it for you.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:10.090
It'll be better if you're in the shot, right?

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.350
There's no need.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:13.340
It's fine, just give it here.

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:22.360
We're sending it to her, so come on and give me your best smile.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:28.870
Why don't we all take pictures together when Yoshizuki and Morisaki arrive?

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.530
Idiot! There's no need to go that far!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:32.840
Why?

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:38.680
I really don't get what you're thinking sometimes.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.830
I don't know if you're kind or just indecisive.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:44.030
You're so unpredictable.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:48.350
Besides, you usually do completely the wrong thing when your moment comes along.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.020
You really should do something about that.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:55.580
Otherwise, you'll never get a girlfriend.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:02.550
Looking back, I was the same then, as well.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:08.080
Even I didn't know what I was thinking. I kept drifting one way and then the other.

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.920
The day after Itsuki's apartment caught fire...

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:15.610
...I came down with a fever.

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:22.720
Just what am I doing?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:27.490
Until yesterday, I'd been trying to confess my love to Iori-chan.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.910
But do I really love her?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.150
How do I feel about Itsuki?

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:46.350
Itsuki didn't come to see me the entire time I was in bed.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.170
Hey! Feeling better?

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.460
Huh? Yeah...

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.700
Are you hungry?

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.600
I'll make something to eat.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:05.640
You don't need to.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.210
I don't need an upset stomach too...

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:08.620
Right?

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:13.570
Hey! What's that supposed to mean? You... You... You...

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:13.570
Get the hell off me! You're heavy!

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:17.220
"Heavy"? You think it's right to call a lady "heavy"?!

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.230
Y-Yes!

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.530
Hey, stop it already!

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.010
Yoshizuki?

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:30.980
Hello.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.050
Hey...

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:38.790
Hey, why are you acting so dopey? She's here to see how you're feeling.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:42.800
Oh, come in... though my room's a bit messy...

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:45.680
Then, just for a little.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.220
I'll make you guys some coffee.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.220
I'll do it.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.430
Don't worry about it.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.620
You're letting me stay here. It's the least I can do.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:55.230
But...

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:59.110
Don't worry. I wouldn't put anything funny in it.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.370
Right?

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.940
Hey! Of course you wouldn't! Dummy!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.430
The one who says dummy first is the real dummy!

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.320
What did you say?!

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.320
You're dumb! Dummy!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.250
It's nice to be close, isn't it?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.450
You're like brother and sister.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:14.170
Hear that?

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:21.340
Aren't you glad we're not like a couple?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.920
Idiot! Stop mocking me.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.970
Iori-san, please help yourself.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.010
I'm glad everyone's all right.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.610
Huh? Right!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.490
Well, absolutely.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:51.530
Oh, I meant... Itsuki-chan.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.910
Oh, yeah...

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.790
I heard everything burned up.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.140
Absolutely everything was in ashes!

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:02.750
But she doesn't seem to be worried about it.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.960
She said she didn't have much anyway.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:05.800
Is that so?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.090
Yeah.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.350
Anyway, what happened on the school trip after I left?

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:21.610
Oh, Teratani-kun knocked down all the souvenirs stacked in a shop.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.690
It was a real mess!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.690
I'll go make the coffee again...

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:29.000
Now that you mention it, I didn't get to buy any souvenirs.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:32.120
That's what I thought, so I got you a present.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.200
You did? Really?

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.140
Enmusubicchi?

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.190
I was looking for a souvenir...

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:43.320
...and the shrine maiden suggested buying this.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:48.420
She saw us trying to walk under the Torii.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:53.970
She must have thought we were a couple.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.290
Icchan, you should take a bath.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:22.290
Hey, knock before you come in.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.290
Hey, What is this? An Enmusubicchi?!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.100
Did you get this for me as a souvenir?

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.420
Hey! Don't be shy!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.190
To tell you the truth, I think the name's kind of lame,

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:36.310
but I'll be happy to take it!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.430
You know, Itsuki, that's actually...

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.020
All right!

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:43.650
Hee! This is the first time you've given me a gift.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:47.190
This'll be my new treasure, since I lost the clay bust!

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.220
Take good care of it.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.120
Sure!

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:11.050
By the way, Icchan, will you do something about your hair?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.200
What?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.060
It's getting really messy.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:16.890
Huh? Do you think so?

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:21.890
My artistic instincts are filling my head with ideas for your hair!

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:23.850
What?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.950
Are you sure you know what you're doing?

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.660
You should trust my tastes.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.740
Your tastes?

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.160
You mean like those creepy sculptures?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:41.910
Something wrong with them?

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:44.690
Nothing's wrong with them...

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.290
...but I don't want anything crazy...

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:50.800
Just be quiet. You won't regret it.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:56.800
You've got to look cool, or Iori-san won't go for you.

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:21.690
Not bad, Itsuki! You're really good with your hands!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.010
Told you so!

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.130
Oh no...

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:35.300
I'm so refreshed! I feel like a new man now!

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:40.820
Well, I owe you one.

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:42.930
What do you want? Just name it!

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.400
Can it really be anything?

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.030
Uh, Itsuki...

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.290
Huh?

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:01.000
Are you sure this is a good idea?

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.870
Why not? I want to feel your warmth.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.200
My warmth?

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.320
I get cold at night.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.880
I have a hard time sleeping when it's like that.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.760
Am I your heating pad?

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:18.510
We used to sleep like this all the time.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:22.580
But we were little kids back then.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:25.220
Besides, well, I'm a guy now. You know?

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:29.130
If you try anything weird, I'll tell Iori-san.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:31.930
Just joking.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.630
I'll take what you told me the other day as a joke too.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.550
I'll forget everything tomorrow.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:43.740
So just for tonight... please?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.890
Icchan, you're warm.

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:13.060
She's sleeping so innocently.

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.580
Hey, Ichitaka!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.830
How did it go yesterday?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.840
Don't play dumb!

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:35.090
I know...

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.960
Yoshizuki! Didn't she come to see you?

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.040
She asked me to go with her, but I said no.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.830
I thought you guys should be alone!

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.090
I see.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.390
So, where is it?

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:49.640
What?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:52.900
Come on! The souvenir that Yoshizuki bought for you.

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:56.860
Good morning, Seto-kun!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.140
Teratani-kun, too!

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.650
Good morning!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.520
Hey! I heard you two got a matching pair.

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:08.730
Ichitaka, why don't you show me yours?

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:12.410
It's all right, Teratani-kun. I didn't mean to be like that.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.590
Sorry, Yoshizuki.

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:21.880
I gave it to Itsuki.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:26.100
She really wanted to have it.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:27.470
I'm sorry.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:32.980
Don't worry. As long as she liked it, then I'm...

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:34.850
I have to go now.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.190
You idiot! Why do you always do the wrong thing?

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.320
That was Yoshizuki's special souvenir for you!

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:43.900
It's not the wrong thing.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.640
This is just fine.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.010
It's not fine!

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.080
You guys are finally getting on well, too!

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:53.470
I think maybe Iori-chan and I weren't meant to be a couple after all.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:56.110
Where the heck are you getting that from?

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:57.800
I don't get it!

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:01.210
I don't want to hurt Itsuki any more.

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.670
What happened?

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:08.370
Ichitaka, why don't you tell me?

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.330
I saw it.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.620
She was crying.

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:16.730
It really hurt me.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:19.220
Ichitaka, don't tell me you...

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.730
I don't want to see...

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.240
...Itsuki's face like that any more.

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:37.250
Hey! You didn't have to buy it right away.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.250
But I want to send it to Itsuki as soon as possible.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.740
Why don't you go on ahead?

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:45.090
I'll go to the post office and mail this out.

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:47.590
Oh, well.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.020
I'll go with you.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.570
But you know what, I kind of understand now.

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:59.230
The reason Itsuki-chan fell for you...

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.230
What's wrong?

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.170
Nothing...

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:12.090
It's just that guy looked a lot like Samejima.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:12.740
Really?!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:20.800
He's been following Yoshizuki since the hidden video camera incident got him expelled from the school.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.500
Do you remember the beauty pageant, too?

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.940
We were also to blame for that one.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.430
Huh? Well... yeah...

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.560
If we hadn't got involved,

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:35.990
Iori-chan would never have had a scary experience like that.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:41.110
I'm home.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:42.020
Oh, welcome back.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.230
What are you doing?

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.280
I'm making a shopping list.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:51.730
I see. You lost everything in the fire.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.490
I can't make up my mind.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.250
I guess I can't just buy everything at once.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.750
Do you want me to go with you?

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.040
What?

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:02.750
Shopping.

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:05.120
I'll go with you.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:06.280
Can you?

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.940
I have nothing else to do.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:09.800
That's not what I meant.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.290
Is it really okay to accept your offer?

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:19.310
Only if you buy lunch.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:20.990
I will!

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:23.580
Sushi or Yakiniku! Anything you want!

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:29.840
Can you pick them out with me?! Come on, come on!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.840
Don't pull me!

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.050
Hey! Look! Isn't this cute?

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:35.050
This might be good too! I'm so divided!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.210
Hey, Ichitaka!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.330
What's up?

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.190
All the high school photography clubs in our district...

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:57.250
...decided to have a beauty pageant.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.980
And Yoshizuki was selected as the candidate from our school.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.480
That's awesome, Yoshizuki!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:08.230
I can't accept. Please look for someone else.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.610
No way...

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.820
They just want to take some pictures of you.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.950
But, I don't want to be involved with that kind of thing any more.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.800
There must be some way.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:21.370
It'll be a real problem if you refuse.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:25.020
Yoshizuki, you can trust him.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.420
I guarantee it.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.470
But...

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:30.500
The photo will only be published in the school paper.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.510
And they won't let you do any kind of sexual pose. Right?

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:34.590
Of course not!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:37.420
See? Why don't you help him out?

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:40.100
Seto-kun, what do you think?

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.520
Why don't you do it?

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:49.690
I'll be proud of you as your friend, besides, wouldn't it be a good advertisement for your drama club?

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:54.320
If you say so...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:59.110
Then, you'll do it? Thank you very much!

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:01.820
Okay, I've got to get going.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:03.410
Hey, Ichitaka!

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.400
Is that all right, Ichitaka?

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:12.170
I think Iori-chan can get the grand prize!

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.170
That's not what I'm asking!

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:18.740
How can you forget about her so quickly?

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:28.770
Hello...

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:34.660
Richard? It's you? Oh, it's been a long time since...

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:45.090
This is like a dream.

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:46.200
What is?

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:50.040
To be able to walk with you like this.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:58.470
I hope that I can walk with you like this for a long time.

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.140
Let's go to the next place.

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.140
Yes.

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:13.230
Matsuo?

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:15.740
Matsuo!

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:22.740
Wait right here.

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.550
Matsuo, wait a second!

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:31.170
Why are you trying to run away? Isn't today the photo shoot?

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.170
I'm sorry!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.200
Matsuo?

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.050
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:54.360
Excuse me, is anybody here?

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:58.310
Are you Yoshizuki Iori-san?

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:00.030
Um... where is Matsuo?

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:03.530
Oh, sorry. Everybody seems to be late.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.790
I see.

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:09.500
Can you change first and wait for them?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.790
The changing room is beyond that door.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.470
Yes.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:29.890
What the hell? You're already wearing your swimsuit?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.230
You took away one of the best parts.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:48.400
What am I going to do? They are going to have Yoshizuki...

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:51.920
Itsuki...

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.700
Listen, Itsuki...

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.450
What are you doing? Just hurry and go!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.100
What are you going to do if something happens to Iori-san?!

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:07.950
Itsuki...

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.140
Sure brings back memories.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:14.500
You really did a number on me.

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.690
Changing without taking off your uniform...

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:19.730
...and finding the hidden camera...

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:23.230
I had to quit school because of you.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:27.210
My life was ruined because of you!

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:31.750
Let me go, or I'll report this to the police!

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:37.000
Do you want me to make the video we're shooting public?

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:41.860
Hey! Why don't you try to enjoy this?

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:46.110
No! Don't touch me!

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:48.020
Don't say that!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:49.680
I couldn't forget...

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.810
...about you!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.610
Stop it!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:08.410
Seto-kun!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.410
You bastard! I remember you!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:15.210
I told you to take your disgusting hands off of her!

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:18.150
Don't act like a hero, you idiot!

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:22.340
Do you think you can fight against all of us?

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:28.460
Seto-kun, please run! I'm not sure what they'll do to you!

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:29.430
Shut up!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:31.670
Iori-chan!

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.350
You bastard! I'll kill you!

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:44.480
Stop it!

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:46.400
I'm begging you!

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:48.410
Stop it already!

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:57.540
Why are you taking it so far?

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:03.090
Do you like this girl that much?

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:06.230
I'm...

00:22:10.070 --> 00:22:13.520
I'm just trying to...

00:22:17.740 --> 00:22:20.770
Looks like you guys are really having fun!

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:23.570
Teratani-kun!

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:29.570
Do you mind if we join the fun?

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:31.830
You guys...

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:35.540
Looks like you took good care of my pal Ichitaka.

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:38.330
Hey, guys! Let's start the party!

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:43.670
Hey! You guys!?

00:22:43.690 --> 00:22:46.260
I'll never give up.

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:48.890
You are my prey!

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:53.260
Ichitaka!

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:06.030
Are you all right, Yoshizuki?

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:07.780
I'm sorry.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:10.280
You had to go through this because of me.

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:12.750
I'm the one who has to apologise.

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:14.230
I'm sorry.

00:23:14.230 --> 00:23:17.160
I told you to do this, and you ended up in such a scary situation.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:18.830
But how?

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:22.660
I ran into Matsuo by coincidence.

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:25.340
I guess Samejima threatened him.

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:26.530
I see.

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:30.220
But, Teratani, why are you here?

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:32.800
Itsuki-chan called me.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:35.550
She said that you went to save Yoshizuki by yourself,

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:37.690
so she wanted me to go and help you.

00:23:37.690 --> 00:23:38.970
Itsuki said that?

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:42.150
Were you with Itsuki-chan before coming here?

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:44.600
Uh... yes.

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:46.900
Then, you should go back to her quickly.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:51.380
I'm sure she's worried about you now.

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:53.280
So, hurry, okay?

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:55.970
Right.

00:23:56.480 --> 00:23:58.700
Teratani, please look after her.

00:24:02.780 --> 00:24:05.160
Are you okay letting him go, Yoshizuki?

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:08.810
But, Seto-kun was on a date with Itsuki-chan.

00:24:08.810 --> 00:24:12.340
I'm asking about your feelings.

00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:18.510
I think they're a good couple. Seto-kun and Itsuki-chan...

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:23.020
I'll change my clothes.

00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:40.950
I have to go back quickly. I have to go back to Itsuki.

00:24:44.050 --> 00:24:45.310
Itsuki!

00:24:45.310 --> 00:24:47.760
Oh, Icchan? Back so soon?

00:24:47.760 --> 00:24:49.470
Where were you?

00:24:49.470 --> 00:24:51.100
Oh, I was making a phone call.

00:24:51.100 --> 00:24:52.120
A phone call?

00:24:52.120 --> 00:24:54.510
Oh no! You're all banged up. Are you all right?

00:24:54.510 --> 00:24:56.760
I'm all right.

00:24:56.760 --> 00:24:59.460
Was Iori-san okay?

00:24:59.460 --> 00:25:01.230
Thanks to you.

00:25:01.230 --> 00:25:04.530
There's no way I could have done anything by myself.

00:25:05.530 --> 00:25:07.950
I really am useless.

00:25:07.950 --> 00:25:10.150
Your feelings are what's important.

00:25:10.680 --> 00:25:12.800
You went there, and risked your life to save Iori-san.

00:25:12.800 --> 00:25:14.780
Those were your feelings.

00:25:14.780 --> 00:25:18.110
It's not because it was Iori.

00:25:18.110 --> 00:25:20.870
If you were in danger, I'd do the same thing.

00:25:21.430 --> 00:25:25.120
I think so too. Since you're so kind, Icchan.

00:25:26.440 --> 00:25:28.630
Are you being sarcastic?

00:25:29.550 --> 00:25:32.340
By the way Icchan, can I tell you something?

00:25:32.340 --> 00:25:33.880
What?

00:25:33.880 --> 00:25:39.050
I got a call from a work acquaintance in America.

00:25:39.050 --> 00:25:42.170
They're looking for someone to work on a new Hollywood movie.

00:25:42.670 --> 00:25:44.660
Although it's a small budget film,

00:25:44.660 --> 00:25:47.590
the director is looking for good sculptors.

00:25:47.590 --> 00:25:49.380
It sounds like a really challenging project.

00:25:49.380 --> 00:25:50.270
Hey, Itsuki...

00:25:50.270 --> 00:25:52.910
And he's asking me if I'm interested in joining...

00:25:52.910 --> 00:25:54.900
Listen to me!

00:25:57.430 --> 00:25:59.110
Can we have a real relationship?

00:25:59.110 --> 00:26:01.850
Don't go anywhere! Just stay with me!

00:26:01.850 --> 00:26:03.960
Thank you, Icchan.

00:26:05.050 --> 00:26:09.020
But I already agreed to go, over the phone just now.

00:26:14.630 --> 00:26:18.220
Itsuki, you've got it all wrong.

00:26:18.220 --> 00:26:21.840
You think I chose Iori-chan over you, because I left to save her.

00:26:21.840 --> 00:26:23.080
Don't you?

00:26:23.080 --> 00:26:25.830
No, Icchan. That has nothing to do with this.

00:26:25.830 --> 00:26:27.640
Then why?!

00:26:27.640 --> 00:26:31.880
When I saw your face before you left to save Iori-san,

00:26:31.880 --> 00:26:33.980
it made me realise.

00:26:34.820 --> 00:26:39.670
The Icchan I saw then is the one I like.

00:26:39.670 --> 00:26:42.320
The Icchan who sincerely cares for Iori-san.

00:26:42.320 --> 00:26:45.500
That's what I like about the real Icchan.

00:26:46.950 --> 00:26:50.460
You're not yourself without Iori-san.

00:26:55.180 --> 00:26:57.780
You need Iori-san.

00:27:00.850 --> 00:27:02.850
Be honest and admit it.

00:27:21.550 --> 00:27:29.200
The worn-out diary

00:27:29.200 --> 00:27:36.840
I left behind in a corner of the classroom

00:27:36.840 --> 00:27:45.280
I closed it softly. I hold this throbbing in my heart

00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:56.080
In both hands and warm it up

00:27:56.080 --> 00:28:03.320
Since that day I met you by chance,

00:28:03.320 --> 00:28:10.980
I've grown small wings

00:28:10.980 --> 00:28:18.370
I felt your kind gaze,

00:28:18.370 --> 00:28:26.340
And even now I have a feeling I could fly into the sky

00:28:26.340 --> 00:28:29.930
Staring eyes and eyes
